Imveliso bhala: 1.23, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['1.23'] umbhalo), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['1,23'] inani umbhalo inani), umgca-omtsha. # 1,23 no longer valid
Imveliso bhala: (['1,23'] inani umbhalo inani umbhalo), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['1.23'] inani, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['1.23'] raw number, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['1.23'] raw number umbhalo, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['1.23'] raw number umbhalo inani, umgca-omtsha.
>> x := (3.5 × 1000000 + 1.5).
Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.
>> x := (3.5 × 100000 + 0.0001 ).
Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.
>> x := (3.5 + 1000).
Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.
x := x umbhalo.
Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.
>> y := x inani.
Imveliso bhala: y, umgca-omtsha.